-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5162+ to 5169+) **Enlarged, excentered the Foreign Advisor**'s (F4 key) screen, and refined its tabs so they can display **up to 12 players** and **overall more information** so **less scrolling** is needed while still **preserving key relevant information** for display (scoreboard, map, commerce sliders and values, etc.). The code was also refactored to improve **dynamic scaling**, ensuring most UI elements automatically realign if dimensions are changed in [CvForeignAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvForeignAdvisor.py) and [CvExoticForeignAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvExoticForeignAdvisor.py). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5166+) Did a similar rework of the **Military Advisor** (F5 key) in [CvMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMilitaryAdvisor.py). See [Other advisors' rework](/README.md#other-advisors-rework).
